id: pm-rl-history-status-roles
title: Use configured terminal status roles when projecting improver history
description: "The existing projectImproverHistory implementation recognizes terminal events using literal closed, canceled and cancelled strings. Histories from trackers with custom terminal status registries can be omitted from the public improver dataset. The new proposer consumes sealed datasets and its public validation uses SDK roles; change the existing history builder separately with persisted-format compatibility coverage."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: follow-up,"gh:unbraind/pm-rl#175",status-registry
created_at: "2026-11-04T21:26:37.249Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-14T13:36:06.383Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Resolve terminal roles through the source tracker SDK status registry; preserve supported historical dataset behavior; verify randomized custom registries and non-git runtime consumers.
parent: pm-rl-apvf
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T12:15:28.195Z",codex-rl-apvf-1114,"Main remeasurement passed 8/8 selected process/LM tests (zero failures, skips or cancellations), including two generations, process contention, SIGKILL recovery, cancellation, contamination and invalid checkpoints. The existing controller slices are delivered. Implement the outstanding configured-status collection criterion using the SDK status registry at the pinned source commit; preserve old sealed datasets and verify a fresh public non-git CLI run. No dependency pins or statistical thresholds change."
  "2026-11-14T12:27:11.123Z",codex-rl-apvf-1114,"Implementation reads status definitions from the same pinned Git tree as histories, resolves roles/aliases through the pinned SDK, and preserves legacy projection calls and sealed dataset formats. Added seeded registry/alias tests, real SDK file-container equivalence, pinned-versus-working-schema divergence, and non-git readers. Isolated behavioral reverts for literal improver terminals, literal dataset statuses, omitted registry forwarding, and working-tree registry reads all typecheck and fail their retained regression; restored tests pass. Existing loop transactions, leases, history-sealed verdicts and approval budgets remain authoritative; this read-only collection fix adds no second controller or budget store."
  "2026-11-14T12:35:43.107Z",codex-rl-apvf-1114,"Final targeted evidence for the configured-terminal collection slice (main base b2c1cfbd950d674183d5713b2f90d165efcb5f7b):\n\nFresh packed public CLI run: unbraind/pm-ops at eba7d5262fd75e67afce0caad29dae7dc7dfbaeb; copied source and controller are non-git scratch projects. All 300 durable source files remain unchanged (SDK runtime caches excluded). Corpus snapshot e45e6205eddf35edc2167d253a2ef1fb5ce2a4c4116557497f1e24da2230b656; programme digest 17720f2c1e58043c8374024cfe63b25c710b0d11ada35705690dd4b0e6dd58c2. There are 105 training and 41 held-out items. Existing examples/loop-corpus.json thresholds and schedule are unchanged; a separate scratch Decision approves two promotions, 16 optimizer updates, 10000 wall milliseconds, 524288 staging bytes, 2000 CPU milliseconds and zero tokens.\n\n| Generation | Source checkpoint SHA-256 | Candidate checkpoint SHA-256 | Exact held-out | Sampled incumbent -> candidate | Decision |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 17493680209cdf2fc86126ff2ad0b7bb6063ae24ce00f28f931224bb5ab2fd11 | 2df645949b852625c2acdc20bf5232620cac8c87d1ab1f8f85c4221da14ac605 | 0.5979768545815656 | 0.499825 -> 0.597650 | promote |\n| 2 | 2df645949b852625c2acdc20bf5232620cac8c87d1ab1f8f85c4221da14ac605 | 3e31b06286e99d6b3d73486216f98f0c6d519228cac4bcbefc56f4945c292863 | 0.6810112913266447 | 0.595100 -> 0.685825 | promote |\n\nGeneration two collected with generation one's promoted checkpoint. Real rl loop resume returns the same terminal checkpoint; independent post-replay SDK reads confirm exactly two jobs and unchanged checkpoint bytes and resource charges. Both jobs settle eight updates once; 512 collection samples total and 40000 evaluation episodes per side per generation. This is finite-corpus adaptive validation, not independent tracker transfer power. Complete minimized implementation/artifact hashes, sealed decisions, process charges and replay receipts are in docs/history-status-roles-evidence.json; explanation and the fresh gap table are in docs/recursive-improver.md.\n\nBehavioral reverts, each in a disposable copy with retained tests: (1) projectImproverHistory literal terminals; (2) trackerHistoryExample literal statuses; (3) buildImproverDataset omits registry forwarding; (4) committedTrackerStatusRegistry reads working settings. All four npm run typecheck commands exit 0 and all four selected regression commands exit 1 on assertions. Commands are node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern=\"SDK roles\" test/history-status-roles.test.ts for (1)/(2), and the same command with --test-name-pattern=\"improver builder pins\" for (3)/(4). Restored complete regression file passes 3/3.\n\nFinal targeted coverage run passes 18/18; the additional existing source-path test passes 1/1. Touched files: 462/462 lines, 305/305 branches, 79/79 functions; the repo's V8 statement measurement over these fresh exact-source reports is 303/303 blocks. All four thresholds remain 100. Linked pinned pm test run passes 3/3. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run lint, npm run docstring (572 declarations) and npm run duplicates (zero clones) pass. Full release certification is delegated to exact-head CI as requested. No new SDK gap or dependency-pin change. Follow-up pm-rl-prefix-status-roles tracks the separate history-prefix vocabulary; this item stays in progress for orchestrator verification.\n"
  "2026-11-14T12:53:33.668Z",codex-rl-apvf-1114,"Code, focused coverage, real public CLI evidence and revert proofs are committed in 82e1200. The shared-runner publication hold is active and has been extended; waiting before the authorized push and PR creation. No further product changes or test processes are pending."
  "2026-11-14T13:08:03.134Z",codex-rl-apvf-1114,"Additional isolation proofs complete coverage of each new regression: ignoring optional SDK file hydration and removing the source-relative schema guard each typecheck and fail node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern=\"committed registry\" test/history-status-roles.test.ts. Omitting registry forwarding in buildTrackerDataset typechecks and fails the improver builder pins selection. Together with the earlier four proofs there are seven typechecking behavioral reverts, all failing retained assertions; the final restored file passes 3/3. Source, thresholds and focused coverage totals are unchanged. Documentation also distinguishes external-job resource allowances from independently measured whole CLI elapsed time."
  "2026-11-14T13:26:40.474Z",codex-rl-apvf-1114,"Published PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/175 after observing the shared-runner hold. Executable source and tests are 82e1200; complete seven-revert documentation is 1d173c6. Initial CI run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/43599156664 has npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 full gates pending, with CodeQL in run 43599156623. The final metadata-only push will require fresh exact-head CI; its live check entry point is https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/175/checks. The existing 30-minute CI cutoff is 13:49 UTC. Targeted evidence remains 19 passing coverage regressions, 3 linked regressions, seven typechecking reverts that fail retained assertions, and unchanged 100 percent in all four touched-source coverage dimensions. No full-gate or review-quorum approval is claimed. Item remains in progress for orchestrator verification; releasing only this agent claim."
  "2026-11-14T13:36:06.383Z",codex-rl-apvf-1114,"Final CI observation for published head c2b5c8817b9273aa8499b2b891d95d210b0481b1: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/43599804333 is cancelled. Its npm Node 22/26 and Bun Node 26 jobs each have an empty steps array: zero gate steps executed. CodeQL https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/43599804360 is also cancelled. No replacement run exists. These cancellations are missing evidence, not approval. A renewed shared-runner publication hold is active; no rerun or further push bypasses it. Implementation, seven-proof documentation and initial CI handoff are already pushed in PR 175. This final tracker-only cancellation receipt is committed locally for the orchestrator to publish after the hold. Targeted code/test evidence remains unchanged and passing; no item is closed and this agent claim remains released."
